Package: BayesFuseMR
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Fused Shrinkage Estimation for Mendelian Randomization
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Julien", "St-Pierre", email = "julien.st-pierre@umontreal.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements fused shrinkage models for Mendelian Randomization using 
    hierarchical priors. Includes functions for model fitting via cmdstanr, and tools for 
    postprocessing and visualization.
